  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Supabase Setup**\n\nI\'m currently focused on evaluating the Supabase setup requirements. The user has an existing Supabase configuration, which I\'m now reviewing to ensure it\'s compatible with the project needs. The intention is to build a dedicated Supabase configuration.\n\n\n**Defining Supabase Module**\n\nNow, I\'m working to outline the contents of `src/lib/supabase.ts`. It\'ll house the Supabase client initialization, drawing credentials from environment variables or local storage. Helper functions like `getSupabaseConfig()`, `saveSupabaseConfig()`, and testing/sync functions (`testSupabaseConnection()`, `syncFromSupabase()`, `syncToSupabase()`) are planned. This should also include UI components so the user can control settings. I\'m also ensuring we can handle document uploads for songs as needed, up to five per song!\n\n\n**Adding Document Uploads**\n\nI\'m now integrating document uploads for songs. I\'ve defined the `SongDocument` interface, including fields like `name`, `type`, `dataUrl`, and `fileSize`, to support different file types. This will be an array on the `CatalogSong` type, limiting uploads to a maximum of five documents per song. A new function, `addSongDocument`, will be included to manage uploads, as well as modifications to `StorageEngine`. The button label will also change to eliminate user confusion.\n\n\n**Implementing Document Features**\n\nI\'m now implementing the functionality to manage song documents. This involves adding functions for adding and deleting documents while enforcing the limit of five per song. I\'m focusing on ensuring the `documents` array is correctly initialized and synchronized between local storage and Supabase. I\'m also working on the UI components, specifically icons and a modal (`SongDocumentsModal` or `PartituraViewerModal`), for displaying, uploading, previewing, and managing attached files, including a clear counter. Finally, I\'m adjusting the color palette to be black.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 21935831
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
