  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Song Document**\n\nI\'ve defined the `SongDocument` interface. It includes the document\'s `id`, `name`, `type` (\'pdf\', \'image\', or \'other\'), a `dataUrl` (Base64 or Object URL), `fileSize`, and `createdAt` timestamp. This structure ensures all relevant song document metadata is captured.\n\n\n**Analyzing Form Requirements**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `CatalogView.tsx` component, specifically the song creation form. I\'m focusing on incorporating a \"Partituras / Anexos\" section to allow users to upload sheet music. The plan is to include a file input supporting drag-and-drop or click-to-upload, and to provide visual feedback for pending files. I intend to display a list of attached files, showing their names, types, sizes, and a removal option. There will be size and quantity limitations enforced, and all data collected will be passed to `StorageEngine.addCatalogSong()` on form submission.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 415225765
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
