    thinking: "**Analyzing Feature Enhancements**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the \"Criar Convite\" feature, specifically its implementation within `ProfileView.tsx` and `SetlistDetail.tsx`. My current focus is refining this new feature and the enhancements needed to display it, with a specific focus on the integration within the existing interface. The user query regarding the convites is helping to frame the needs.\n\n\n**Implementing Invitation Workflow**\n\nI\'m now outlining the \"Criar Novo Convite\" functionality. I\'ll place the button in `ProfileView.tsx`. Clicking it will trigger a modal with setlist selection, an invited email field, and permission settings (edit/view). An \"Enviar Convite\" action will handle the local storage update via `StorageEngine.sendInvitation()` and will attempt to upsert data to Supabase if available, syncing local data in the process. I\'ll provide a success toast for the user.\n\n\n**Adding Copy Functionality**\n\nI\'m now integrating a \"Copiar para Minha Conta\" feature for invited setlists. I\'ll add a button to `SetlistDetail.tsx` and ensure a duplicate action is available in `SetlistsList.tsx`, too. The flow involves duplicating the setlist locally with `StorageEngine`, syncing with Supabase if available, and providing a success toast. I\'ll also ensure clear labeling, especially on shared setlists, and will then navigate to the newly copied setlist. I\'ll be sure to check other locations where invitations may be listed or created.\n\n\n"
